{"id":"ccbc15:problem:4-36","answer":"CONSTANCE","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>这是卡牌游戏三国杀的求杀题。求杀题是指给定一个局面，求出题目所需的特定卡牌，使得目标玩家能够确保击杀敌方玩家。</p>","text":"这是卡牌游戏三国杀的求杀题。求杀题是指给定一个局面，求出题目所需的特定卡牌，使得目标玩家能够确保击杀敌方玩家。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>请根据每组的牌面情况，计算每个问号处可以有多少张（注意是张数，不是种类）符合要求的牌并转字母。</p>","text":"请根据每组的牌面情况，计算每个问号处可以有多少张（注意是张数，不是种类）符合要求的牌并转字母。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"external_only","format":"text","html":"<p><a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DSERrekJhanBtRXZl?tab=BB08J2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">解析链接</a></p>","text":"解析链接","refId":null,"assetIds":[]},"extended":{"html":"<p>你要离开之前，获得了一份旅游指南，你注意到其中一句话被圈了出来：“没想到这里也加入了新丝路！”</p>","text":"你要离开之前，获得了一份旅游指南，你注意到其中一句话被圈了出来：“没想到这里也加入了新丝路！”","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem","content-type":1,"external_solution_snapshot":{"source_url":"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DSERrekJhanBtRXZl?tab=BB08J2","page_raw_path":"data/raw/ccbc15/external_solutions/36-DSERrekJhanBtRXZl.html","page_bytes":446624,"page_sha256":"786cd0e965aac984bacfd5b0baad92a381e6cb166cbfdeba9c502f397a5571a3","data_snapshot":{"source_url":"https://docs.qq.com/dop-api/opendoc?tab=BB08J2&u=&noEscape=1&enableSmartsheetSplit=1&startrow=0&endrow=60&needSheetState=1&sliceStates=1&&block_end_col=31&block_end_row=255&block_start_col=0&block_start_row=0&id=DSERrekJhanBtRXZl&normal=1&outformat=1&wb=1&nowb=0&callback=clientVarsCallback&xsrf=abc06ed2a0406dd0&t=b90de84592fe4755b668e068b3532e9d","raw_path":"data/raw/ccbc15/external_solutions/36-DSERrekJhanBtRXZl-opendoc.js","bytes":25722,"sha256":"9d5783bacb5dceab56b62d85b5a2e1d1713ae5efd85c25b694e01f9b0036edf8","format":"Tencent Docs opendoc JSONP with compressed sheet protobuf blocks"}}},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[]}
